{"4128050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RoboFarm", "steam_appid": 4128050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/8b1ba014ce63f53d9bfa7ad75739b787.avif?t=1786647634\" width=782 height=184 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RoboFarm</strong> is a semi-idle, cozy, incremental, automation-robot-powered farm builder all about crafting clever builds, unlocking synergies, conquering dynamic events, and making money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Dream Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c57fbf532b803092e7e0b1dec95fb8dc.poster.avif?t=1786647634\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c57fbf532b803092e7e0b1dec95fb8dc.webm?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c57fbf532b803092e7e0b1dec95fb8dc.mp4?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance your futuristic farm</strong> with decorative upgrades, powerful boosts, and hardworking automated robots that keep everything running smoothly. Create from small garden patches to giant farms, customizing every space with handcrafted designs that show off your style. Unlock new crops, expand into fresh zones, and add upgrades for nonstop efficiency and profit. Build smarter, grow bigger, and turn your automated oasis into a thriving robotic empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start  Small and Earn Money to Build Your Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/706fff802546631bd9a268281cd3a3dd.poster.avif?t=1786647634\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/706fff802546631bd9a268281cd3a3dd.webm?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/706fff802546631bd9a268281cd3a3dd.mp4?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock unique produce, decorate your land</strong> with custom creations, and watch your income soar. Use top-down mode to build and design your farm more effectively. With top-down mode, you have a clear view of your farm. Easily construct paths, harvest plants, and enjoy the view. Then upgrade, automate, and keep pushing your farm’s value higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Farms of Any Size</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/0b992c1d0c634133bf86bba6e200a9eb.poster.avif?t=1786647634\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/0b992c1d0c634133bf86bba6e200a9eb.webm?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/0b992c1d0c634133bf86bba6e200a9eb.mp4?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From small farms to medium, big, and gigantic farms,</strong> grow your own vegetable paradise from the ground up. Start with a few patches of soil, expand your fields, and plant a colorful variety of crops. Every harvest brings rewards and gets you closer to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manually Harvest to Level Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c4b00dfadb0093d250ce80b55c405124.poster.avif?t=1786647634\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c4b00dfadb0093d250ce80b55c405124.webm?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c4b00dfadb0093d250ce80b55c405124.mp4?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed up the development of your farm by harvesting manually.</strong> While your trusty robots handle most of the work, stepping in yourself gives an instant boost to productivity. Earn achievements, level up faster, and make extra profit as you lend a helping hand to your automated crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Even While Offline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/76167b885bec1ac3c8a9874f35ec3f40.poster.avif?t=1786647634\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/76167b885bec1ac3c8a9874f35ec3f40.webm?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/76167b885bec1ac3c8a9874f35ec3f40.mp4?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your farm will make money even when you are offline</strong>, so progress never stops. Harvest crops by hand to level up, unlock new produce, and boost your income through strategic upgrades and automation. Place powerful decorations to enhance efficiency, then step away while your robot workforce continues to generate rewards. Save and share your farm creations with other players, create multiple farms, and return at any time to expand, optimize, and push your profit potential even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine Natural Events and Power-ups to Create Powerful Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c2c919724a8068744bd9bc3582196911.poster.avif?t=1786647634\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c2c919724a8068744bd9bc3582196911.webm?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c2c919724a8068744bd9bc3582196911.mp4?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance your farming efficiency with different elements.</strong> Different types of natural rain modify your game, either positively or negatively. With power stations, you can manually toggle powers that give you significant, temporary boosts for your farm. Add special decorations that increase your harvest value, augment positive natural events, or improve your offline earnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize the Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/984ab595e58533554806ebdc33e841e7.poster.avif?t=1786647634\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/984ab595e58533554806ebdc33e841e7.webm?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/984ab595e58533554806ebdc33e841e7.mp4?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take complete control of your farm’s atmosphere</strong> with dynamic lighting and time-of-day settings. Rotate the sun, cast dramatic shadows, and adjust the mood to match your creative vision. Switch to nighttime to watch your robots, plants, and decorations glow with vibrant illumination. Whether you want a bright, colorful daytime farm or a calm, neon-lit tech oasis, you can personalize every moment of your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect RoboTokens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/331fbd90ca8fe3b478b9289f2a28dd1e.poster.avif?t=1786647634\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/331fbd90ca8fe3b478b9289f2a28dd1e.webm?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/331fbd90ca8fe3b478b9289f2a28dd1e.mp4?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RoboTokens are your essential currency for expanding creativity on the farm.</strong> Use them to unlock new robots, powerful upgrades, and decorations that enhance both style and productivity. Earn RoboTokens by leveling up or placing special décor that generates them over time. The more you collect, the more freedom you’ll have to shape your farm exactly the way you imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Attributions</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Icons by Freepik, Icongeek26, SA Family, dDara, photo3idea_studio, imaginationlol, max.icons, Smashicons, Mihimihi, monkik, AomAm, dreamicons, Umeicon, Futuer, Paul J., kerismaker, Rikas Dzihab from </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RoboFarm</strong> is a semi-idle, cozy, incremental, automation-robot-powered farm builder all about crafting clever builds, unlocking synergies, conquering dynamic events, and making money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Dream Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c57fbf532b803092e7e0b1dec95fb8dc.poster.avif?t=1786647634\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c57fbf532b803092e7e0b1dec95fb8dc.webm?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128050/extras/c57fbf532b803092e7e0b1dec95fb8dc.mp4?t=1786647634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance your futuristic farm</strong> with decorative upgrades, powerful boosts, and hardworking automated robots that keep everything running smoothly. Create from small garden patches to giant farms, customizing every space with handcrafted designs that show off your style. Unlock new crops, expand into fresh zones, and add upgrades for nonstop efficiency and profit. Build smarter, grow bigger, and turn your automated oasis into a thriving robotic empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 